OL,3,GNEWSAResidents who fled fire say block
OL,4,Awas 'not safe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in an east London tower block
OL,7,Fhave questioned whether their homes
OL,8,Fwere safe after a major water leak in
OL,9,Fthe building because hours later a fire
OL,10,Fbroke out.
OL,12,FOne man died and more than 50 others
OL,13,Fwere made temporarily homeless after
OL,14,Fthe blaze on the 17th floor of Neutron
OL,15,FTower, Poplar shortly after 04:30 BST
OL,16,Fon Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
