OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAResidents who fled fire say block
OL,4,Awas 'not safe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe building was evacuated while the
OL,7,Fwater was being pumped out. Residents
OL,8,Fwere advised by the London Fire Brigade
OL,9,F(LFB) to return home once that work was
OL,10,Fcomplete but some fear the leak led to
OL,11,Fan electrical fault, causing the fire.
OL,13,FThe LFB said all residents' concerns
OL,14,Fwould form part of its investigation
OL,15,Fwith the Met Police and urged people
OL,16,Fnot to speculate.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
